vocabulary bundle <http://clinical-axis.org/method/bundle#> as vocab-bundle {

    includes <http://clinical-axis.org/method/base#>
    includes <http://clinical-axis.org/method/alignment#>
    includes <http://clinical-axis.org/method/components#>
    includes <http://clinical-axis.org/method/lifecycle#>
    includes <http://clinical-axis.org/method/governance#>
    includes <http://clinical-axis.org/method/verification#>
}